      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely, here is a draft for your review:\n\n\"Dear [Account Executive's Name],\n\nI want to commend you on your outstanding performance in maintaining client retention and ensuring the satisfaction of our largest accounts. Your strategic insights and proactive approach have been invaluable to our team. However, I have noticed a recurring pattern that requires our attention – your punctuality to our internal morning stand-up meetings. While we understand that unforeseen circumstances can occasionally cause delays, it's crucial to respect our team's time and the subsequent impact on collaborative efforts. I trust you will take this to heart and prioritize punctuality moving forward, ensuring a more efficient and harmonious work environment for all.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]\"\n\nI hope this feedback encourages the needed improvements without affecting morale.",
